#
# Constructed, not recorded: an MX Keys S charging at 95 % and an MX Master
# 3S at 20 % on a Bolt receiver, each with FeatureSet at 1, DeviceName at 2
# and UnifiedBattery at 3. After the reads the mouse reports low (12 %), then
# critical (4 %), and the keyboard a complete charge. For trying out the tray
# and the notifications: hidsight --replay with a developer build.
